m/godotengine/godot/pull/123996","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123996.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123996.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123964\r\n- Closes #123786\r\n- Closes #120051\r\n- Closes #109494\r\n- Closes #100955\r\n- Closes #106098\r\n- Closes #97704\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAudioStreamMP3 and AudioStreamOGGVorbis now provide the offset value in expected samples based on server mix rate.\r\n\r\nThe position AudioWorklet now correctly accounts for the playback rate (pitch scale) applied to the chunk being processed.\r\n\r\nLooping is now done using the native loop/loopStart/loopEnd properties of AudioBufferSourceNode for maximum precision (forward-only, like before).\r\n\r\nThe position when looping is now computed based on the accurate samples reported by the position worklet.\r\n\r\nThe driver has been refactored in its own closure (with extensive type annotation for the closure compiler) and is now properly initialized and de-initialized with the rest of GodotAudio.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123996/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":9,"rocket":3,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123996/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}